flowchart TD
    I[Request + context + history + available tools] --> T[Tool selector]
    T -->|call| A[Required from schema + argument selector]
    A --> V[Value selector]
    V --> E[env.validate]
    E -->|invalid| F[Actual environment feedback]
    E -->|valid| C[env.call]
    C --> F
    F --> T
    T -->|ask| Q[env.validate + env.call sys.ask_missing_info]
    Q --> S[Stop]
    T -->|done| S
